      "evidence_id": "ev-453e2bf4ae8b012c7b0238aa",
      "path_or_url": "apiary.md",
      "section": "Cooperative apiary handbook",
      "snippet": "# Cooperative apiary handbook\n\nThis handbook collects independent work instructions and building information for the cooperative apiary. Each named procedure has its own scope.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "8238cdd94d2d7d198ff6d78060690afa9f2bb4f03bad13022a8e2fe788c266d5",
      "project_identity": "local:acb5e5e75abfaf1a9bb9adeff00dd0e06b19acc898568512a61bce7dc8c50030",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 4,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/b81df1b05098e7d675f097e5"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-5a18a128e0df1e95cbb21c9b",
      "path_or_url": "apiary.md",
      "section": "Cooperative apiary handbook > Moving occupied hives",
      "snippet": "## Moving occupied hives\n\nThe instructions in this section apply only to occupied hives moved between stands inside the same apiary. Moving a hive to another site requires a separate transport plan.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "0bde953e53b91f453905d17be44823df72a0041c9cd087277f74d3174c5c8dbf",
      "project_identity": "local:acb5e5e75abfaf1a9bb9adeff00dd0e06b19acc898568512a61bce7dc8c50030",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 8,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/ac37f36c41f31221a91f287c"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-d79dc159fd0bbfb14b03d6db",
      "path_or_url": "apiary.md",
      "section": "Cooperative apiary handbook > Moving occupied hives > Entrance preparation",
      "snippet": "### Entrance preparation\n\nClose the hive entrance with a ventilated transport screen after the last flying bees have returned. Keep the screen unobstructed throughout the move.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "107679f0541294710bdcae95d902820375e82e15286a77202fd339706708c0ca",
      "project_identity": "local:acb5e5e75abfaf1a9bb9adeff00dd0e06b19acc898568512a61bce7dc8c50030",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/71094e5ce0d4802e4115e658"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-2e5378237232431a3cb41090",
      "path_or_url": "apiary.md",
      "section": "Cooperative apiary handbook > Moving occupied hives > Securing the boxes",
      "snippet": "### Securing the boxes\n\nFasten the hive boxes and floor together with two ratchet straps before lifting. Lift the secured hive with two people and place it level on the new stand.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "235325d59e8d20d0999bca97420d9479195febf9abcbb3be8ea3bd6437f3368e",
      "project_identity": "local:acb5e5e75abfaf1a9bb9adeff00dd0e06b19acc898568512a61bce7dc8c50030",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 16,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/a4413bcee1683a66dee21cd9"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-878319bae34fc1bdcfa19744",
      "path_or_url": "apiary.md",
      "section": "Cooperative apiary handbook > Moving occupied hives > Reopening",
      "snippet": "### Reopening\n\nRemove the transport screen after the hive is stable on its new stand. Place a leafy branch across the entrance to encourage returning bees to reorient.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "ecd3ff94f627c6c76ddcd50df71065c5949688f95e46d1300d0593bda4655112",
      "project_identity": "local:acb5e5e75abfaf1a9bb9adeff00dd0e06b19acc898568512a61bce7dc8c50030",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/c2d775b58eacd818e192b45f"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-c060c67d3dab5afadedcd340",
      "path_or_url": "apiary.md",
      "section": "Cooperative apiary handbook > Moving occupied hives > Trolley paint",
      "snippet": "### Trolley paint\n\nThe equipment trolley is painted cream. Touch-up paint and brushes are kept in the garden shed; paint colour does not identify a hive's destination.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "50d7d0ab958aa0289c9b51c4686a174160e175b0efa35afe4ec599d2e0dd0fe1",
      "project_identity": "local:acb5e5e75abfaf1a9bb9adeff00dd0e06b19acc898568512a61bce7dc8c50030",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 24,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/e27382ac61a5e9a55d6719b0"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-901575b9ea9ca9e92991a2c2",
      "path_or_url": "apiary.md",
      "section": "Cooperative apiary handbook > Queen inspection exception",
      "snippet": "## Queen inspection exception\n\nAn occupied hive awaiting completion of a queen inspection must not be moved between stands, even when the entrance has been screened and the boxes are strapped. Complete and record the queen inspection before scheduling the move.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "bbff353bcbc90b0052f7cba40150cf8d92265ced04890300f0f8af8dcf5a8e2c",
      "project_identity": "local:acb5e5e75abfaf1a9bb9adeff00dd0e06b19acc898568512a61bce7dc8c50030",
      "line_start": 25,
      "line_end": 28,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/21d6910ea5a660acaec4e3ac"
    }
